  "summary_text": "Intro call with Delta Pharma's Commercial Excellence Manager about a CRM for medical representatives. Delta Pharma is not a client in the CRM yet.",
  "summary_markdown": "Intro call with Delta Pharma's Commercial Excellence Manager about a CRM for medical representatives. Delta Pharma is not a client in the CRM yet.",
  "private_notes_text": null,
  "private_notes_markdown": null,
  "transcript": [
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "Hi Livia, nice to meet you. Thanks for accepting the invite.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-04T19:00:07Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-04T19:00:11Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Livia Prado"
      },
      "text": "Hi Ana. A colleague recommended you, so I wanted to understand what you do.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-04T19:00:13Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-04T19:00:18Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "Happy to explain. But first, tell me a bit about Delta Pharma.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-04T19:00:24Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-04T19:00:29Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Livia Prado"
      },
      "text": "We're a mid-sized pharmaceutical company. We have about one hundred and fifty medical representatives who visit doctors and pharmacies every day.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-04T19:00:30Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-04T19:00:38Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Livia Prado"
      },
      "text": "Their visit reports are in a very old system that nobody likes. I'm looking at options for next year.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-04T19:01:15Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-04T19:01:22Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "What would a better tool need to do for the representatives?",
      "start_time": "2026-11-04T19:03:40Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-04T19:03:44Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Livia Prado"
      },
      "text": "Plan the visits, record what was discussed, and track samples. And it has to work on a tablet.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-04T19:03:47Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-04T19:03:54Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone",
        "attribution": "me"
      },
      "text": "We have pharma clients doing exactly that. I'll send you a short overview after the call.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-04T19:09:20Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-04T19:09:26Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Livia Prado"
      },
      "text": "Great. I'll share it with my director.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-04T19:09:31Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-04T19:09:34Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "attribution": "them",
        "name": "Livia Prado"
      },
      "text": "Thanks, Ana. Nice to meet you.",
      "start_time": "2026-11-04T19:25:40Z",
      "end_time": "2026-11-04T19:25:42Z"
    }
  ]
}
